b release" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.thedarkskyxd.streamfusion.dev" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[129,1633][858,1696]" drawing-order="1" hint="" /><node index="1" text="" resource-id="" class="com.horcrux.svg.SvgView" package="com.thedarkskyxd.streamfusion.dev" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[899,1638][951,1690]" drawing-order="2" hint=""><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="com.horcrux.svg.GroupView" package="com.thedarkskyxd.streamfusion.dev" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[918,1651][931,1677]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="com.horcrux.svg.PathView" package="com.thedarkskyxd.streamfusion.dev" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[918,1651][931,1677]" drawing-order="1" hint="" /></node></node></node><node index="15" text="Android 0.1.4-alpha.1 release notes&#10;# StreamFusion Android 0.1.4-alpha.1&#10;&#10;This prerelease adds the in-app Android updater and the recent mobile UI and chat improvements.&#10;&#10;- Update availability popup, background checks when opening the app, live download progress, cancel and retry, and Android installation approval.&#10;- Mobile screens, sheets, Settings text and icons aligned with the desktop app.&#10;- Expanded chat events, channel and role badges, and provider badge styling.&#10;- Guest browsing and mobile workflow improvements.&#10;&#10;## Install or update&#10;&#10;Download StreamFusion-android-v0.1.4-alpha.1.apk below and open it on Android 11 or newer. Keep the existing production app installed to preserve your data. Android may ask you to allow installation from the app that opens the APK.&#10;&#10;Older releases need this APK installed manually once to receive the new updater. After that, open Settings &gt; Updates in StreamFusion, select Check now, and download an available release inside the app. The popup shows bytes and percentage. When verification finishes, select Install and approve Android's prompt. The development app uses a separate package and is not replaced by this production APK.&#10;&#10;## Known limitations&#10;&#10;Twitch and Kick account sign-in is still being completed. This is an alpha release.&#10;&#10;## Verify the files&#10;&#10;The release includes android-update.json, build-info.json, and SHA256SUMS. The APK uses the existing pinned StreamFusion production signing certificate.&#10;&#10;Run `sha256sum --check SHA256SUMS` in the directory containing the downloaded release files." resource-id="update-release-notes" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.thedarkskyxd.streamfusion.dev" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[86,1747][994,2163]" drawing-order="16" hint="" /></node></node><node index="10" text="" resource-id="navigation-bottom" class="android.view.View" package="com.thedarkskyxd.streamfusion.dev" content-desc="Primary navigation" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,2163][1080,2400]" drawing-order="10" hint="" /><node index="11" text="" resource-id="nav-search" class="android.view.View" p